## 5. PROTOCOLO DE DISTRIBUCIÓN SEGURA

### 5.1 Tiendas de Aplicaciones

```yaml
# app-store-distribution-protocol.yaml
Apple_App_Store:
  family_category_requirements:
    - age_range_specification: mandatory
    - privacy_policy_kids: mandatory
    - coppa_compliance: mandatory
    - no_external_links: enforced
    - no_advertising_tracking: enforced
    - in_app_purchases: parental_control_required

Google_Play_Family:
  designed_for_families_program:
    - target_age_group: required
    - content_rating: IARC_required
    - privacy_policy: kids_specific
    - ads_and_monetization: family_appropriate
    - data_collection: minimized

  data_safety_section:
    - data_collection_disclosure: complete
    - data_sharing_disclosure: complete
    - security_practices: documented
    - data_deletion: available
```

